WEBVTT

52:01.061 --> 52:05.190
Gods know there aren't many feather beds
between here and King's Landing.

52:05.315 --> 52:07.317
If you see my brother Bran,

52:07.442 --> 52:10.070
tell him I miss him.

52:10.904 --> 52:12.322
Tell him I'd visit if I could.

52:12.447 --> 52:13.699
Of course.

52:14.783 --> 52:16.243
He'll never walk again.

52:16.368 --> 52:20.163
If you're going to be a cripple,
it's better to be a rich cripple.

52:20.288 --> 52:22.666
You take care, Snow.

52:22.791 --> 52:24.626
Farewell, my lord.
